  "overview": {
    "title": "Where Nador comes out after dark",
    "p1": "The corniche runs along the lagoon and has become the city’s social living room: families, cafés, soft light and a breeze off the water.",
    "p2": "It is not monumental architecture; it is everyday Mediterranean town life. That is the value — orientation on day one and a place to return each evening.",
    "p3": "Pair a corniche walk with seafood and a simple first look at Marchica before you plan longer outings."
  },
