    "hero_title": "Corniche",
    "hero_subtitle": "Discover the authentic charm and unique experiences of Corniche.",
    "sec1_title": "Overview & Cultural Heritage",
    "sec1_text": "Located in one of Morocco's most picturesque regions, Corniche offers visitors an immersive journey into rich heritage, stunning architecture, and warm local hospitality.",
    "sec2_title": "Things to See & Local Experiences",
    "sec2_text": "Whether you are exploring historical sites, tasting traditional Moroccan flavors, or discovering surrounding natural landscapes, Corniche provides memorable moments for every traveler.",
